<title>USA: Eastman Chemical to acquire ABCO assets.</title>
<headline>Eastman Chemical to acquire ABCO assets.</headline>
<dateline>ROEBUCK, S.C. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Chemical Co said Friday it entered into a letter of intent to purchase assets of ABCO Industries Ltd.</p>
<p>Terms of the pending purchase were not disclosed.</p>
<p>ABCO, which began as a family operation in 1961, produces waterborne sizing and coating products.  Eastman manufactures and markets chemicals, fibers and plastics.</p>
